      "widgets_values": [
        "GK H3 Dataset Builder - URL SOURCES (yt-dlp)\n\nPut one video URL per line in 'source_urls' (blank lines and '#' comments\nignored). They are downloaded with yt-dlp into tempdel/work/downloads and\nfed through the same pipeline as local files. You can also set\n'source_folder' to mix local + URL sources.\n\n  url_max_height = 0  -> best available quality\n  allow_playlists     -> download every entry of a playlist/channel URL\n  keep_downloads      -> keep + cache downloads for reruns (off = delete)\n\nRequires: pip install yt-dlp (and ffmpeg on PATH). You are responsible for\ncomplying with each site's Terms of Service and copyright."
      ],
